{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for an object. If visible, move to it. Then take it. Check its properties. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    />  <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    />\"",
